- POS / `AppLogin/loginPOS` / wiring `PDV` in the Portal/Application UI
- BMD entity generation / standard Cadastro form / dedicated MFA admin page
- Remember-device checkbox in the MFA challenge UI
- Skipping our TOTP because Azure already did MFA
